      "end_codepoint": 15,
      "source_quote": "穎川周昭著書稱歩騭及嚴畯等曰：",
      "reading": "敘者標明周昭著論，論及步騭、嚴畯等人。",
      "chapter_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete",
      "source_id": "s-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116:reading-000-124",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116",
      "person_id": "5sl_p6s_iab",
      "related_person_ids": [],
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 124,
      "source_quote": "古今賢士大夫所以失名喪身傾家害國者，其由非一也，然要其大歸，總其常患，四者而已。急論議一也，爭名勢二也，重朋黨三也，務欲速四也。急論議則傷人，爭名勢則敗友，重朋黨則蔽主，務欲速則失德，此四者不除，未有能全也。當世君子能不然者，亦比有之，豈獨古人乎！",
      "reading": "周昭先列損人、敗友、蔽主、失德之四患。",
      "chapter_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete",
      "source_id": "s-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116:reading-124-157",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116",
      "person_id": "5sl_p6s_iab",
      "related_person_ids": [
        "syc_ik6_bq5_**AA",
        "lpo_z63_vzb",
        "snv_2iq_jes",
        "szg_rhg_18d",
        "roi_rz4_ute_B"
      ],
      "start_codepoint": 124,
      "end_codepoint": 157,
      "source_quote": "然論其絶異，未若顧豫章、諸葛使君、歩丞相、嚴衞尉、張奮威之爲美也。",
      "reading": "列五人官稱，張奮威指任奮威將軍的張承。",
      "chapter_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete",
      "source_id": "s-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116:reading-157-254",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116",
      "person_id": "5sl_p6s_iab",
      "related_person_ids": [
        "syc_ik6_bq5_**AA",
        "lpo_z63_vzb",
        "snv_2iq_jes",
        "szg_rhg_18d",
        "roi_rz4_ute_B",
        "fp6_ia6_7yw"
      ],
      "start_codepoint": 157,
      "end_codepoint": 254,
      "source_quote": "《論語》言『夫子恂恂然善誘人』，又曰『成人之美，不成人之惡』，豫章有之矣。『望之儼然，即之也溫，聽其言也厲』，使君體之矣。『恭而安，威而不猛』，丞相履之矣。學不求祿，心無苟得，衞尉，奮威蹈之矣。",
      "reading": "取《論語》及儒者行誼，分舉顧邵、諸葛瑾、步騭、嚴畯、張承。",
      "chapter_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete",
      "source_id": "s-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116:reading-254-287",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116",
      "person_id": "5sl_p6s_iab",
      "related_person_ids": [
        "syc_ik6_bq5_**AA",
        "lpo_z63_vzb",
        "snv_2iq_jes",
        "szg_rhg_18d",
        "roi_rz4_ute_B"
      ],
      "start_codepoint": 254,
      "end_codepoint": 287,
      "source_quote": "此五君者，雖德實有差，輕重不同，至於趣捨大檢，不犯四者，懼一揆也。",
      "reading": "五君德實有差，論者以其同不犯四患。",
      "chapter_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete",
      "source_id": "s-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116:reading-328-358",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line116",
      "person_id": "5sl_p6s_iab",
      "related_person_ids": [
        "lpo_z63_vzb",
        "snv_2iq_jes",
        "szg_rhg_18d"
      ],
      "start_codepoint": 328,
      "end_codepoint": 358,
      "source_quote": "使君、丞相、衞尉三君，昔以布衣俱相友善，諸論者因各敘其優劣。",
      "reading": "三君為諸葛瑾、步騭、嚴畯。",
      "chapter_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete",
      "source_id": "s-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line118:reading-000-075",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line118",
      "person_id": "5sl_p6s_iab",
      "related_person_ids": [
        "szg_rhg_18d",
        "snv_2iq_jes",
        "lpo_z63_vzb"
      ],
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 75,
      "source_quote": "初，先衞尉，次丞相，而後有使君也。其後並事明主，經營世務，出處之才有不同，先後之名須反其初，此世常人所決勤薄也。至於三君分好，卒無虧損，豈非古人交哉！",
      "reading": "周昭記三人早先品次、實際任官及始終交好。",
      "chapter_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete",
      "source_id": "s-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line118:reading-135-222",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line118",
      "person_id": "5sl_p6s_iab",
      "related_person_ids": [
        "szg_rhg_18d",
        "lpo_z63_vzb",
        "snv_2iq_jes",
        "fp6_ia6_7yw"
      ],
      "start_codepoint": 135,
      "end_codepoint": 222,
      "source_quote": "後徙九列，遷典八座，榮不足以自曜，祿不足以自奉。至於二君，皆位爲上將，窮富極貴。衞尉既無求欲，二君又不稱薦，各守所志。保其名好。孔子曰：『君子矜而不爭，群而不黨。』斯有風矣。",
      "reading": "嚴畯的職位、俸祿與另外兩君並論，又引孔子語。",
      "chapter_id": "c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete",
      "source_id": "s-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete"
    },
